    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you use a spell slot to cast a Transmutation spell that doesn't make an attack roll or force a saving throw, such as Fly or Magic Weapon, you can increase the spell's effective level by 1. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Intelligence modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
